{"3571580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ABSTRACTICA", "steam_appid": 3571580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of <strong>ABSTRACTICA</strong>, where geometric shapes have gone rogue, and the emptiness is <i>all-consuming</i>. Traverse this vast void on your quest to save art from total abstraction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/9d267d8f4795e81e0c51b831c029b0f4.poster.avif?t=1782381256\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/9d267d8f4795e81e0c51b831c029b0f4.webm?t=1782381256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/9d267d8f4795e81e0c51b831c029b0f4.mp4?t=1782381256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this third person shooter with roguelike elements, you fight your favourite geometric shapes like <i>Triangles</i>, <i>Circles </i>and <i>Squares</i>, and go face to face with the <i>Mona Lisa</i> to find out the secret behind the phenomenom known as... <strong>ABSTRACTICA</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/7f04e1f231ceccacfdee2283a57ddda5.poster.avif?t=1782381256\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/7f04e1f231ceccacfdee2283a57ddda5.webm?t=1782381256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/7f04e1f231ceccacfdee2283a57ddda5.mp4?t=1782381256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <u>switch from Light Mode</u> and <u>Dark Mode</u>, to change the dynamic of the run on the fly, and unleash the power of your everchanging environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/e982a6a1138a4767e51c3291ff151202.poster.avif?t=1782381256\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/e982a6a1138a4767e51c3291ff151202.webm?t=1782381256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/e982a6a1138a4767e51c3291ff151202.mp4?t=1782381256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapon with a variety of upgrades that will give you the ability to shoot<strong> better</strong>, jump <strong>higher</strong> and be (a little more) <strong>indestructible</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/6e94f1c0a02d63c285acbef5036a49db.poster.avif?t=1782381256\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/6e94f1c0a02d63c285acbef5036a49db.webm?t=1782381256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/6e94f1c0a02d63c285acbef5036a49db.mp4?t=1782381256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> As your art collection grows, your ability to fight back against ABSTRACTICA becomes more diverse than you could imagine!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of <strong>ABSTRACTICA</strong>, where geometric shapes have gone rogue, and the emptiness is <i>all-consuming</i>. Traverse this vast void on your quest to save art from total abstraction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/9d267d8f4795e81e0c51b831c029b0f4.poster.avif?t=1782381256\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/9d267d8f4795e81e0c51b831c029b0f4.webm?t=1782381256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/9d267d8f4795e81e0c51b831c029b0f4.mp4?t=1782381256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this third person shooter with roguelike elements, you fight your favourite geometric shapes like <i>Triangles</i>, <i>Circles </i>and <i>Squares</i>, and go face to face with the <i>Mona Lisa</i> to find out the secret behind the phenomenom known as... <strong>ABSTRACTICA</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/7f04e1f231ceccacfdee2283a57ddda5.poster.avif?t=1782381256\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/7f04e1f231ceccacfdee2283a57ddda5.webm?t=1782381256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/7f04e1f231ceccacfdee2283a57ddda5.mp4?t=1782381256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <u>switch from Light Mode</u> and <u>Dark Mode</u>, to change the dynamic of the run on the fly, and unleash the power of your everchanging environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/e982a6a1138a4767e51c3291ff151202.poster.avif?t=1782381256\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/e982a6a1138a4767e51c3291ff151202.webm?t=1782381256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/e982a6a1138a4767e51c3291ff151202.mp4?t=1782381256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapon with a variety of upgrades that will give you the ability to shoot<strong> better</strong>, jump <strong>higher</strong> and be (a little more) <strong>indestructible</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/6e94f1c0a02d63c285acbef5036a49db.poster.avif?t=1782381256\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/6e94f1c0a02d63c285acbef5036a49db.webm?t=1782381256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/extras/6e94f1c0a02d63c285acbef5036a49db.mp4?t=1782381256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> As your art collection grows, your ability to fight back against ABSTRACTICA becomes more diverse than you could imagine!</p>", "short_description": "In this fast-paced third person shooter with roguelike elements, you are tasked with recovering art that has mysteriously gone rogue. Fight abstract shapes like triangles, tangrams and even an abstract Mona Lisa to uncover the mystery of ABSTRACTICA.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c